    "transcription": "Decoded original standard-format RT_MENU 2 bytes from gold-resources/.rsrc/MENU/2, extracted from the Gold executable by 7-Zip. UTF-16LE labels, accelerator text, nesting, original flags, command IDs and separators are preserved. Native command mappings and disabled states were checked against cmd/winfe/res/gold-browser-menu.rc.",
    "policy": "Only metadata is committed. No vendor executable or resource binary is included.",
    "shared_menus": "Mail, news and message composition retain the standard-edition fixtures; this fixture replaces only the Gold browser menu. The Window placeholder is checked before runtime population."
  },
